PHASE II: MICRO-OP INJECTION (MOI) FOR SUB-NANOSECOND ISS\uc0\u8232 Standard software instructions are too slow for cycle-accurate control. Axion v.1.0.0 resolves Problem #1 (ISS Latency) via Decoder-Level Injection.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 A. Pipeline Gap Insertion\
Axion utilizes the PMU and LBR at the Ring -1 level to monitor the Instruction-Fetch stage. Axion injects "Deterministic Gaps" (Micro-Pause Uops) directly into the pipeline during decoding.\
Equation 1: Harmonic Stall Density (D_s)\
D_s = (N_uop_holes / N_total_ops) * F_clock\
