PHASE V: DDIO-FABRIC INJECTION AND CACHE CLOISTERING\uc0\u8232 Axion utilizes Intel DDIO and RDT at the boot-level to bypass the memory wall.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 A. The DDIO-Bypass Mechanism\
In Axion Fabric v.1.0.0, the DDIO-Injektio forces DMA writes directly into the L3-Cache (Way 0-7) of the processor.\
Logic: By updating MSR_DDIO_CONTROL and setting the "Way-Mask" via Intel RDT, Axion bypasses the 60ns DRAM latency entirely.\
